<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.keeps ~ a scratch sensorium kept

`lares sensorium keep <id>` retains one live scratch sensorium, so no exit dissolves it. An id that stands nowhere answers exit 3.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`keep` params=`id/s-1 ~ retain a live sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ id

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`id` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<id> ~ the live sensorium's id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.scratch.keeps id/s-1]] ~ name the id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ kept · absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`kept` params=`exit/0 fields/[[existed]] ~ the sensorium stands kept`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`absent` params=`exit/3 ~ no sensorium stood under that id`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sensorium keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares sensorium keep]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

